            "sid": "NUM 3:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo pa Merari aye doggola pa jo pa Makali ki doggola pa jo pa Muci; meno aye doggola pa jo pa Merari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Welgi ka gikwano Wel co ducu cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo oromo alip abicel, ki miya aryo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ladit ki i ot pa kwarogi ma i doggola pa jo Merari obedo Juriel wod pa Abikail. Gin yam giguro kemagt i ŋet kema yo tun acam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tic ma gimiyo bot likwayo pa Merari obedo me gwoko lwak guti me kema, lwak riine, lwak wirre lwak tedi tere ki gin ma okemo ticce ducu; dog tic ducu ma mitte pi jami magi ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ka dok lwak wir ducu ma gurumo dyekal, ki tedi tergi ki lwak teke lagurgi, ki lwak tolle.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
