          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jo ma yam giguro kemagi i nyim kema yo tuŋ wokceŋ, i nyim kema me rwatte ka ma cen tuc iye-ni, gin aye Moses ki Aron ki awobene. Gin onoŋo gityeko ketogi i dog tic ma i kabedo maleŋ, pi tiyo tic ducu ma mitte pi jo Icrael; ka ŋat mo mukene onyiko cok, myero ginek woko. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wel jo Levi ducu ma yam gikwano, ma Moses ki Aron gukwano welgi pi lubo cik pa Rwot, kun lubo doggolagi, co ducu cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo, oromo alip pyeraryo wiye aryo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
