          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Rwot owaco bot Moses ni, “Kwan wel litino kayo ducu ma co ki i kin jo Icrael, cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo; kwan welgi kun ilubo nyiŋgi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An a Rwot; ibikwanyo jo pa Levi gubed mera ma ka litino kayo ducu ma i kin jo Icrael; dok iter lim makwo pa jo Levi ma ka litino kayo ducu ma i kin lim makwo pa jo Icrael.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kit meno Moses okwano Wel litino kayo ma i kin jo Icrael ducu, macalo Rwot ocike. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NUM 3:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Litino kayo ducu ma co, macalo wel nyiŋgi tye, cakke ki i kom jo ma ditogi romo dwe acel dok kwede malo, ka gikwano welgi onoŋo guromo alip pyeraryo wiye aryo, ki miya aryo ki pyerabiro wiye adek.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NUM.3.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NUM.3.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
